---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<div
  class="mt-8 flex gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface/40 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim"
>
  <Icon
    name="history"
    class="mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 text-[#b08d57]"
    strokeWidth={1.75}
  />
  <p>
    <strong class="font-semibold text-ink"
      >This post is more than 18 months old.</strong
    > Technology changes quickly, so some of this content may be out of date (but
    that's not always the case). Please verify any technical or programming information
    against the current release.
  </p>
</div>
